WEBVTT

00:00:07.991 --> 00:00:09.166
Ow!

00:00:09.775 --> 00:00:11.429
Ow.
[GROWLS]

00:00:11.473 --> 00:00:13.736
You look tense.
I'm not tense.
你看起来很紧张 -我才不紧张

00:00:13.779 --> 00:00:16.826
Angry girl wants
to be doing what
they're doing.
这个生气的女生想做他们在做的事

00:00:17.609 --> 00:00:18.871
I wasn't ready.
我还没准备好

00:00:18.915 --> 00:00:20.090
[ROARS]
撑着 坦克 我来了

00:00:20.133 --> 00:00:22.092
Hang on, Thunk,
I'm coming!
撑着 坦克 我来了

00:00:22.135 --> 00:00:23.876
Why are you doing this?
你干嘛这样

00:00:25.138 --> 00:00:26.488
GUY: What
are they doing?
他们在干嘛

00:00:26.531 --> 00:00:27.837
Hunting.
打猎

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:29.969
THUNK: Get it off!
You stay away from me.
把它弄走 你离我远一点

00:00:30.013 --> 00:00:31.580
No, seriously,
what are they doing?
我说真的 他们在干嘛

00:00:31.623 --> 00:00:34.365
THUNK: You've
got a ton of eggs.
Just make another egg.
你的蛋那么多 再生一个就好了啊

00:00:36.411 --> 00:00:37.586
[THUNK PANTING]

00:00:37.629 --> 00:00:38.804
[SCREAMING]

00:00:41.416 --> 00:00:42.460
[GROANS]

00:00:47.422 --> 00:00:49.380
[ROARS]
你这样很烦

00:00:49.424 --> 00:00:51.382
Now you're just
rubbing it in.
[ROARS]
你这样很烦

00:00:52.688 --> 00:00:55.821
There,
who's hungry for scorpion?
谁想吃蝎子啊

00:00:57.997 --> 00:01:00.609
Uh, what happened to
the egg and the bird?
那只鸟和鸟蛋呢

00:01:00.652 --> 00:01:02.393
Oh.
We lost him.
我们弄丢了

00:01:02.437 --> 00:01:03.873
But when the bird
stepped on me
但是鸟踩在我身上 把我压到土里

00:01:03.916 --> 00:01:05.135
and pushed me
into the ground...
但是鸟踩在我身上 把我压到土里

00:01:05.178 --> 00:01:07.442
the scorpion
grabbed a hold of me...
蝎子就抓住我

00:01:07.485 --> 00:01:09.835
and one thing led to another
and here we are eating him.
然后一件接着一件事

00:01:09.879 --> 00:01:11.097
So, win-win.
所以这是双赢

00:01:11.141 --> 00:01:13.839
Not enough.
Not enough!
I need more.
不够 不够 我还要更多

00:01:13.883 --> 00:01:16.973
I need more.
我还要更多

00:01:17.016 --> 00:01:19.845
Oh, look at that.
Uh, she's not going
to eat me, right?
你看她的样子 该不会要吃我吧

00:01:19.889 --> 00:01:21.238
You're too skinny.
你太瘦了

00:01:21.281 --> 00:01:23.066
If she was going
to eat anyone
it would be--
如果她要吃人 那也是...

00:01:23.109 --> 00:01:24.981
[SCREAMS]
EEP: Mom!
妈

00:01:25.024 --> 00:01:26.678
She's locked her jaw!
她的下巴卡住我了

00:01:26.722 --> 00:01:28.506
Get a stick!
Get a stick!
快找根棍子 棍子啊

00:01:30.377 --> 00:01:31.901
Stay away!
走开

00:01:31.944 --> 00:01:33.642
You sick old monster!
你这变态的老怪物

00:01:33.685 --> 00:01:35.513
Hurry!
Put the stick
in her mouth!
快点 把棍子放到她嘴里

00:01:35.557 --> 00:01:36.993
Whoa, whoa, whoa!
抓好她 拿石头

00:01:37.036 --> 00:01:38.690
GRUG: Hold her still.
Use a rock.
抓好她 拿石头

00:01:39.343 --> 00:01:40.649
[GRUNTS]
娥姐 拜托你敲她的腿

00:01:40.692 --> 00:01:42.694
[GASPS]
Ugga, would you
just hit her legs?
娥姐 拜托你敲她的腿

00:01:43.869 --> 00:01:45.218
Why are you rolling away?
你为什么滚开了

00:01:45.262 --> 00:01:47.438
I just want
something to eat.
我想吃点东西

00:01:47.482 --> 00:01:50.746
You have bug for dinner.
Plenty of bug!
你有虫可以当晚餐 有很多虫

00:01:50.789 --> 00:01:51.790
Please.
拜托

00:01:52.704 --> 00:01:54.358
I'll let you help me hunt.
我让你帮我打猎

00:01:54.401 --> 00:01:56.186
Really?
真的吗

00:01:56.229 --> 00:01:58.841
Don't wait on me.
They're all over me.
不要等我 她们爬满我全身了

00:01:58.884 --> 00:02:00.407
Tell my story.
把我的故事流传下去

00:02:01.974 --> 00:02:03.149
[GRUNTS]

00:02:07.240 --> 00:02:08.546
Okay.
好

00:02:09.591 --> 00:02:10.853
What do you call this?
你叫这个什么

00:02:10.896 --> 00:02:12.202
A trap.
陷阱

00:02:12.245 --> 00:02:13.377
What does it do?
它有什么用

00:02:13.420 --> 00:02:14.465
Well--
这个嘛...

00:02:14.509 --> 00:02:15.553
[WHISTLES]

00:02:15.597 --> 00:02:17.163
[GROWLS]

00:02:17.207 --> 00:02:18.948
Thump, thump, thump,
thump, thump.
[MAKES SPRING NOISE]

00:02:18.991 --> 00:02:20.253
[WHISTLES]

00:02:20.297 --> 00:02:21.428
[IMITATES EXPLOSION]

00:02:21.472 --> 00:02:23.387
Ta-da!

00:02:23.430 --> 00:02:25.563
How long have
you been alone?
你一个人有多久了

00:02:25.607 --> 00:02:26.608
[CHITTERS]

00:02:29.436 --> 00:02:31.917
So, what do we do?
我们接着要做什么

00:02:31.961 --> 00:02:33.092
Ooh...
你会演戏吗

00:02:33.136 --> 00:02:34.964
How's your acting?
你会演戏吗

00:02:35.007 --> 00:02:36.182
[CHITTERS]

00:02:38.228 --> 00:02:39.316
[WHIMPERS]

00:02:40.578 --> 00:02:42.101
[GUY IMITATING FEMALE BIRD]

00:02:45.975 --> 00:02:47.106
[SQUAWKS]

00:02:48.499 --> 00:02:49.500
[CHUCKLES]

00:02:51.763 --> 00:02:52.938
[SQUAWKS]

00:02:55.724 --> 00:02:56.942
[SQUAWKS EXCITEDLY]

00:03:00.467 --> 00:03:01.686
You're good at this.
你很厉害

00:03:01.730 --> 00:03:02.774
[CHUCKLES]
你很厉害

00:03:02.818 --> 00:03:04.428
[CLEARS THROAT]

00:03:04.471 --> 00:03:05.908
Ooh!
[STAMMERS]
不 抱歉

00:03:05.951 --> 00:03:07.605
No. Sorry.
不 抱歉

00:03:07.649 --> 00:03:08.911
Okay.
好

00:03:08.954 --> 00:03:10.652
Yeah, that's yours.
EEP: Excuse me.
对 这是你的 -不好意思

00:03:12.001 --> 00:03:13.524
Your other hand--
你的另一只手...

00:03:13.568 --> 00:03:15.918
That's my arm.
Okay, I'm moving it.
那是我的手臂 -好 我在动了

00:03:15.961 --> 00:03:16.962
[BOTH YELP]

00:03:20.705 --> 00:03:22.098
GUY: Going under.
往下面

00:03:22.664 --> 00:03:23.752
[SQUAWKS]

00:03:25.623 --> 00:03:26.798
[GASPS]
她没有踩进你的陷什么阱的

00:03:26.842 --> 00:03:30.106
Uh, it didn't step in
your trap-y thing.
她没有踩进你的陷什么阱的

00:03:30.149 --> 00:03:32.804
Yeah, I noticed!
对 我发现了

00:03:32.848 --> 00:03:34.023
Ooh!

00:03:35.677 --> 00:03:36.852
[GROANS]
一妹呢

00:03:36.895 --> 00:03:38.027
Ow.
Where's Eep?
一妹呢

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:39.289
[EEP GROWLING]

00:03:42.814 --> 00:03:43.989
[GRUNTING]

00:03:44.642 --> 00:03:46.209
She's awesome.
她超棒的

00:03:46.252 --> 00:03:47.471
[GRUNTS]
一妹

00:03:47.514 --> 00:03:48.559
Eep!
一妹

00:03:49.212 --> 00:03:50.213
Dad, no!
老爸 不要

00:03:51.693 --> 00:03:52.650
GRUG: Ow!

00:03:55.610 --> 00:03:57.046
[SQUAWKS]

00:04:02.007 --> 00:04:04.270
THUNK: It's an avalanche
of flavor.
这真是超好吃的

00:04:04.314 --> 00:04:05.620
[ALL MUNCHING]

00:04:07.622 --> 00:04:08.927
[BOTH GRUNTING]

00:04:17.806 --> 00:04:19.416
Oh!
[GROWLING]

00:04:24.726 --> 00:04:25.683
[GULPS]

00:04:26.771 --> 00:04:27.816
[GRUNTS]

00:04:27.859 --> 00:04:29.513
[GASPS] Oh!

00:04:29.556 --> 00:04:30.645
[SLURPS]

00:04:31.950 --> 00:04:33.996
Looks like we won't
be having any leftovers.
我们应该不会有剩菜

00:04:34.039 --> 00:04:36.085
What are "left overs"?
什么是「剩菜」

00:04:36.128 --> 00:04:38.348
When you have
so much food to eat,
you have some left over.
就是食物太多的时候 剩下来的东西

00:04:38.391 --> 00:04:40.916
Oh... We never
have that much food.
我们的食物从来不会多到剩下

00:04:41.656 --> 00:04:42.874
[SIGHS]

00:04:46.312 --> 00:04:47.444
[BELT CHITTERS]

00:04:50.752 --> 00:04:51.709
[SIGHS]

00:04:53.406 --> 00:04:55.713
Grug, how about a story?
咕噜 说个故事吧

00:04:55.757 --> 00:04:58.542
Oh, that's a good idea.
How about a story? Huh?
好主意 要不要听故事

00:04:58.585 --> 00:05:00.544
Yeah, tell us a story!
好 说故事吧

00:05:03.199 --> 00:05:06.855
Once upon a time,
there was a little tiger...
很久很久以前 有一只小老虎

00:05:06.898 --> 00:05:09.553
who lived in a cave
with her family.
她和家人住在洞穴里

00:05:09.596 --> 00:05:11.163
There were
a lot of rules...
洞穴里有很多规定

00:05:11.207 --> 00:05:16.038
but the big, simple one
was to never leave
the cave at night.
就是晚上不要离开洞穴

00:05:16.081 --> 00:05:20.999
And the door was so heavy,
you'd think it would
be easy to remember.
所以你以为这条规定很好记

00:05:21.043 --> 00:05:22.479
So easy to remember!
很好记

00:05:22.522 --> 00:05:24.524
I know.
[GROANS]
就是说啊

00:05:24.568 --> 00:05:26.875
But, while everyone
was asleep...
不过 当大家都睡着时

00:05:26.918 --> 00:05:28.485
she went out anyway.
她还是跑出去了

00:05:28.528 --> 00:05:30.052
ALL: No!
Yes!
不会吧 -是真的

00:05:30.095 --> 00:05:33.011
And no sooner than she did,
their cave was destroyed...
她一跑出去 洞穴就被毁了

00:05:33.055 --> 00:05:35.753
and everyone had to go
on this long, sucky walk...
大家只好踏上又远 又辛苦的路程

00:05:35.797 --> 00:05:37.712
with some
weirdo they met...
还带着刚认识的怪胎

00:05:37.755 --> 00:05:39.235
and die!
最后死掉了

00:05:39.278 --> 00:05:40.366
[BOTH GASP]
最后死掉了

00:05:41.193 --> 00:05:42.499
The end.
讲完了

00:05:42.542 --> 00:05:43.718
[SCOFFS]
GUY: Whoa!

00:05:43.761 --> 00:05:47.199
I did not see that coming.
Twist ending.
没想到结局是这样 真出乎意料

00:05:47.243 --> 00:05:48.984
My stories never
end like that.
我的故事结局一定不是这样

00:05:49.027 --> 00:05:50.899
Yes! Two stories
in one night!
太好了 一个晚上有两个故事

00:05:50.942 --> 00:05:52.161
[SANDY COOING]
太好了 一个晚上有两个故事

